    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Chole bhature serves 4 and takes about 60 minutes plus resting. Make the bread dough first so it has time to rest. Get the oil hot for frying while the chole simmers."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The frying oil should be hot enough that the bread puffs within seconds."
          }
        ]
      },
